"test15" README
==============

Source: node.c errexit.c

Desc:	test to call "feov" (force end of volumn) processing

Invoke:	load [0] node.rx [/cfs/ctape0 [TEST01 [TEST02 ]]]

Note:	* use 2 scratch tape
	* log is on "test15.SLr0"
	* result is on "test15.SRr0"
	* tape will be unloaded after the test

Algo:	* tapealloc with user exit call
	* tdsopen, twrite 1 dataset, and tdsclose
	* tdsopen with read mode on 1st dataset, feov, tdsclose
	* tapedealloc 
